  "oracle_text": "Henry Wu and other Human creatures you control have exploit. (When a creature with exploit enters, you may sacrifice a creature.)\nWhenever a creature you control exploits a non-Human creature, draw a card. If the exploited creature had power 3 or greater, create a Treasure token."
